      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Equities Mod12-Q1",
        "itemBody": "<p>An analyst observes that a stock’s standard deviation of returns is 30%, and its returns show a correlation of 75% with those of the market. The market returns have a standard deviation of 18%. The stock’s beta is closest to:</p>",
