      "id": "2027-Equi-12-4",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Equities Mod12-Q4",
        "itemBody": "<p>An analyst seeks to estimate the expected rate of return for Air Astana, a publicly traded company based in Kazakhstan. She observes EUR-denominated Kazakh sovereign bonds at 125 bps over the EUR government yield of 3.5%. She estimates an adjusted beta of 1.1 and observes a 4.5% ERP for the STOXX Europe 600 Index used as a developed market reference. If the annualized Kazakh equity market volatility is 1.5 that of the bond market, which of the following is the best estimate of Air Astana’s rate of equity return?</p>",
        "feedback": {
          "neutral": ""
        },
        "interactionData": {
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "f86d5444-467e-4ad2-9829-89368684b23a",
